		{"id":"e3b2c1e616fff655","type":"file","file":"方/07_素材图/临时截图/Pasted image 20260729022123.png","x":-1231,"y":-3389,"width":400,"height":267},
		{"id":"fdacc5166b5e626f","type":"file","file":"方/07_素材图/临时截图/Pasted image 20260729022136.png","x":-1290,"y":-3026,"width":400,"height":263},
		{
			"id":"3546f28d3d9386d5",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"胡逸民：“他们让我告诉你，只要肯写一份声明，家人，性命、高官、后路，都可以谈。”\n",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-540,
			"y":-2944,
			"width":840,
			"height":80,
			"color":"3"
		},
		{"id":"ac5ce300226f2728","type":"text","text":"## SCENE 1：胡逸飞劝降\n方志敏被押进来，脸上身上全是伤，囚服破烂，血在滴。\n\n---\n\n\n","x":19,"y":-3389,"width":430,"height":125},
		{"id":"871e1691e38a07ba","type":"file","file":"方/03_角色卡/方.png","x":19,"y":-3234,"width":400,"height":263},
		{
			"id":"9d0e29e8bf246931",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"\n描写胡逸民的神情。\n“胡兄作为一开始就跟随国民党的高管，\n不也为了兄弟舍弃一切进了监狱吗“\n方志敏掰开饼：“先吃，凉了就不好吃了。 自有人间真情在，干一个。”\n\n",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-16,
			"y":-2444,
			"width":500,
			"height":180
		},
		{
			"id":"70b04cc7d74df43c",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"插入《清贫》画面\n风格：\n场景： 火红的战场\n行为：两个国民党士兵在战场树林掠夺搜身方志敏。\n国民党士兵外貌描述：\n构图：\n共产党方志敏外貌服装描述：灰扑扑的共产党服装（具体样貌？）\n",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-840,
			"y":-2824,
			"width":400,
			"height":240,
			"color":"2"
		},
		{"id":"ad4921a38cfcb3f6","type":"file","file":"方/07_素材图/临时截图/Pasted image 20260729022142.png","x":-1290,"y":-2763,"width":400,"height":263},
		{
			"id":"1487b8925340ae00",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"胡逸民笔挺坐着，干净整洁的囚服。像是跟老熟人聊天。胡逸民举着两个饼子 给一个给方。",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-760,
			"y":-3384,
			"width":320,
			"height":120
		},
		{"id":"cb33047959099550","type":"file","file":"方/方备份/Pasted image 20260728212409.png","x":-731,"y":-3216,"width":400,"height":225},
		{
			"id":"e410fc86c2d3c193",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"方志敏：“高官厚禄吗“\n抬头\n\" 胡兄可知当晚我被捕之事？\"\n\n接清贫画面",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-316,
			"y":-2824,
			"width":670,
			"height":122
		},
		{
			"id":"272f4678ec32fda1",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"两个人坐在草席床上，\n",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-290,
			"y":-3264,
			"width":260,
			"height":60
		},
		{"id":"56c47604f645639c","type":"text","text":"两个士兵贼眉鼠眼的中景别仰视镜头  眼睛睁大 贼笑","x":-740,"y":-2364,"width":200,"height":100,"color":"2"},
		{
			"id":"ae6579252e9a2a2d",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"士兵：这个份量的“大官”身上一定有钱！",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-770,
			"y":-2504,
			"width":260,
			"height":60,
			"color":"2"
		},
		{
			"id":"6b06850cc95b1d20",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"转到背后镜头，士兵搜索方志敏的身",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-446,
			"y":-2364,
			"width":260,
			"height":90,
			"color":"2"
		},
		{
			"id":"0d028ecf24a32d52",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"士兵在搜摸 方志敏的身",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-446,
			"y":-2504,
			"width":260,
			"height":60,
			"color":"2"
		},
		{
			"id":"c1f27bbc8adf2893",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"方：“你我 真的想争夺这高官厚禄吗？”",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":94,
			"y":-2584,
			"width":260,
			"height":80,
			"color":"1"
		},
		{"id":"d4dc5640a75fa249","type":"group","x":-130,"y":-3228,"width":300,"height":445,"label":"画面描述"},
		{"id":"fbf5adc8b6e49915","type":"group","x":-130,"y":-3048,"width":300,"height":257,"label":"动作镜头"},
		{
			"id":"60be6e8fe45752e1",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"胡逸民传给高家俊女友程",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-199,
			"y":-3368,
			"width":260,
			"height":60
		},
		{
			"id":"c57da84fa2906746",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"镜头混乱 速度快 对比清贫的两个国明党的镜头 两个恶魔嬉笑",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-108,
			"y":-3215,
			"width":260,
			"height":105
		},
		{
			"id":"f1fbeefcad7af65c",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"母亲的左臂，连着耳朵到颈，直到胸膛，都被砍下来了",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-108,
			"y":-3027,
			"width":260,
			"height":60,
			"color":"1"
		},
		{
			"id":"dad88c1144abc8e2",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"血在涌流出来",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-108,
			"y":-2945,
			"width":260,
			"height":60
		},
		{
			"id":"515f81142ac39388",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"只是在那里一张一张的动，她的眼泪和血在竞着涌流",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-108,
			"y":-2870,
			"width":260,
			"height":60
		},
		{
			"id":"82cdd6069e7cc1a0",
